<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ceramic Q2 profit falls 32 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ceramic Q2 profit falls 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Internacional de Ceramica SA  ICM.N on Monday said its second-quarter net earnings fell 32 percent to 21.06 million pesos from 30.9 million pesos in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>The company, which makes tile, said in a statement that net sales for the second quarter were 365.35 million pesos. A comparative figure was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
